            <Description>The Greek PhD Theses Corpus is a large-scale, AI-ready text dataset consisting of 55,423 Greek doctoral dissertations produced between 1975 and 2025. It represents the most comprehensive and technically homogenized collection of Greek PhD-level academic writing assembled to date.

